.TH SYSPCKG 8 "2026-09-20" "AdavaLinux" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
syspckg \- SystemPackager 1.0 for AdavaLinux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B syspckg install
package... [--source auto|adava|fedora] [-y]
.PP
.B syspckg remove
package... [-y]
.PP
.B syspckg update
[package...] [--source auto|adava|fedora] [-y]
.PP
.B syspckg upgrade
[package...] [--source auto|adava|fedora] [-y]
.PP
.B syspckg search
term... [--source auto|adava|fedora]
.PP
.B syspckg info
package... [--source auto|adava|fedora]
.PP
.B syspckg list
[installed] [--source auto|adava|fedora]
.PP
.B syspckg repos
.PP
.B syspckg clean
.SH DESCRIPTION
SystemPackager is the AdavaLinux package manager. Version 1.0 uses RPM and libdnf5 directly.
It does not execute the external dnf5 command.
.PP
The old System/1 .syspckg implementation is unsupported and is not installed in current systems.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B install
Resolve dependencies, download RPM archives and install one or more packages.
.TP
.B remove
Remove one or more installed packages.
.TP
.B update
Update selected packages, or all applicable packages when no package is given.
.TP
.B upgrade
Run the upgrade transaction path.
.TP
.B search
Search available package metadata.
.TP
.B info
Show package information.
.TP
.B list
List packages. Use "installed" to limit output to installed packages.
.TP
.B repos
Show configured repositories.
.TP
.B clean
Remove package-manager cache data.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B -y, --assumeyes
Assume yes for transaction confirmation.
.TP
.B --source auto
Use AdavaLinux and Fedora repositories.
.TP
.B --source adava
Use only the AdavaLinux RPM repository.
.TP
.B --source fedora
Use Fedora and Fedora Updates repositories.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B syspckg install htop
Install htop.
.TP
.B syspckg install mc --source fedora
Install Midnight Commander from Fedora.
.TP
.B syspckg search xfce
Search package metadata for XFCE.
.TP
.B syspckg list installed
List installed RPM packages.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /usr/share/dnf5/repos.d/
Repository definitions.
.TP
.B /var/lib/rpm/
RPM database.
.TP
.B /var/cache/libdnf5/
Package and metadata cache.
.TP
.B /var/lib/syspckg/
AdavaLinux SystemPackager state.
.SH VERSION
SystemPackager 1.0 (AdavaLinux).
